{
  "_doc": "Map config (docs/WIDGETS.md). Most callouts come from network features' `callout` property; this file adds system-wide callouts and per-feature `overrides`. Zoom levels (`tiers`, each tier's minzoom; the server scopes /api/snapshot?z=<tier> by the same numbers, L-081): tier 0 = overview (shown from the furthest zoom-out), 1 from zoom 6, 2 from 6.75, 3 from 7.5; `maxzoom` hands a box off to its breakdown. Anchors: a feature id or a region {at:[lon,lat], label}. Rows: {series|feature, label?, unit?, decimals?, ref?, ref_label?, vs_target?, band?, unless_feature?}.",
